+## SL-04 TDD Pilot Result
+
+Implementation date: 2026-08-07
+
+Slice:
+
+- `SL-04` branch/loop cleanup TDD pilot.
+
+Implementation shape:
+
+- Added a reusable cleanup-sensitive control-flow preflight helper that reads
+  fixture source files through `ProjectManifest` and asks generated
+  TypeRef/type-trait metadata whether a source spelling has a cleanup-required
+  provider trait.
+- The fixture runner now emits fixture-keyed blocked rows with stable blocked
+  reason ids instead of marking every complete fixture as completed.
+- `SL-04` now runs as a green row assertion gate: scalar branch completes,
+  runtime-owned branch blocks, and nested branch-in-loop blocks.
+
+Timing snapshot:
+
+| Check | Result | Elapsed | Max RSS | Notes |
+|---|---|---:|---:|---|
+| Baseline `SL-04` expected-red gate before edit | ok expected red | 0.47s | 31,104 KB | 1 matched row, 2 intended mismatches. |
+| Harness-project rebuild | ok | 231.63s | 539,020 KB | Rebuilt the harness project; useful as broad rebuild cost, but not the gate executable used by `SL-04`. |
+| Direct compiler rebuild with `SCPP_NINJA_JOBS=16` | ok | 321.01s | 539,544 KB | Rebuilt `compiler/src/.prism/build/main`; one source transpiled, native rebuild still rebuilt broadly. |
+| First stale-binary `SL-04` run after harness rebuild | failed as expected | 0.26s | 31,232 KB | Proved the gate was still using the old direct compiler executable. |
+| `compiler/tools/run_sl04_branch_loop_cleanup_tdd_gate.sh` | ok green | 0.33s | 31,232 KB | 3 expected rows, 3 observed rows, 3 matched, 0 mismatches. |
+| `compiler/tools/run_90_percent_campaign_smoke_tdd_gate.sh` | ok green | 0.30s | 31,232 KB | Campaign smoke remains green. |
+| `compiler/tools/run_sl_milestone_tdd_gate.sh` | ok manifest_green | 0.24s | 31,360 KB | Milestone is still manifest-level beyond `SL-04`. |
+| `compiler/tools/run_debug_profile_artifact_helpers_audit.sh` | ok | 0.15s | 31,232 KB | Debug/profile helper strategy unchanged. |
+| `compiler/tools/run_tdd_90_debug_profile_artifact_gate.sh` | ok | 0.23s | 31,360 KB | Debug/profile artifact export remains green. |
+
+Timing interpretation:
+
+- The actual TDD gates are fast enough for tight cycles: roughly 0.15s to
+  0.33s in this slice.
+- The compiler rebuild path is the current bottleneck. The direct compiler
+  build rebuilt broadly even after only one source file transpiled, so later
+  TDD work should prefer running gates against an already-built compiler and
+  record rebuild cost separately from gate cost.
+
+Next handoff:
+
+- Continue the reset in inventory order with `SL-05`, but keep each focused
+  task gate row-running before marking that task `green`.
